<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

<title>STRO Review Status</title>

<link
href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css"
rel="stylesheet"
>

<style>

body{
    background:#f4f6f9;
}

.card{
    border:none;
    border-radius:18px;
    box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
}

.badge-status{
    font-size:15px;
    padding:10px 18px;
    border-radius:30px;
}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="container py-5">

<div class="row justify-content-center">

<div class="col-lg-7">

<div class="card">

<div class="card-body text-center p-5">

<h2 class="text-danger mb-4">

⚠ STR Review Not Available

</h2>

<p class="text-muted">

This Suspicious Transaction Report cannot be reviewed at the moment.

</p>

<hr class="my-4">

<div class="mb-3">

<h6>STR ID</h6>

<p class="fs-5 fw-bold">

<%= strId %>

</p>

</div>

<div class="mb-4">

<h6>Current Status</h6>

<span class="badge bg-warning text-dark badge-status">

<%= currentStatus.replaceAll("_"," ") %>

</span>

</div>

<div class="mb-4">

<h6>Required Status</h6>

<span class="badge bg-primary badge-status">

Pending STRO Review

</span>

</div>

<p class="text-muted">

The analyst must update the STR draft and submit it back to STRO before it can be reviewed again.

</p>

<div class="mt-4">

<a
href="/stro/dashboard"
class="btn btn-primary me-2"
>

← Back to Dashboard

</a>

<a
href="/stro/drafts/<%= strId %>"
class="btn btn-outline-secondary"
>

View Draft

</a>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>